  Generation Stratum mean_He
  &lt;chr&gt;      &lt;chr&gt;     &lt;dbl&gt;
1 Final      A         0.432
2 Final      B         0.425
3 Final      C         0.452
4 Start      A         0.386
5 Start      B         0.467
6 Start      C         0.415
